"""UltimateSwapPipeline — highest quality real-time face swap for OBS streaming.

Swap engine: Ghost backend (best available for real-time local inference).
DreamID adapter reserved for when public weights ship — _run_dreamid_swap()
is the single integration point.

Per-frame pipeline (in exact order):
  1.  Detect face (InsightFace RetinaFace) + 468 landmarks (MediaPipe Face Mesh)
  2.  Confidence gate → failsafe if < 0.85
  3.  Temporal landmark EMA (α=0.8, 5-frame window)
  4.  Affine-align face to 256×256 canonical space
  5.  BiSeNet-FP segmentation mask (aligned space)
  6.  Exclude mouth via MediaPipe lip contour indices 61-291, 8px feather
  7.  Gaussian feathering (31×31, σ=5) — INWARD ONLY (never expands past boundary)
  8.  Face Dragon frame-space occluder detection → subtract from mask
  9.  Ghost face swap at 256×256  (DreamID slot)
  10. Real-ESRGAN upscale (4×, optional)
  11. Warp back to frame space
  12. Lab color histogram matching (L, A, B per-channel mean+std)
  13. Poisson seamless clone composite (NORMAL_CLONE)
  14. CodeFormer / GFPGAN face enhancement
  15. Hard-paste original mouth pixels
  16. Temporal output smoothing (0.85 current + 0.15 previous)

Occlusion (Face Dragon technique):
  BiSeNet on ORIGINAL frame crop detects hands/objects as they really appear
  (not distorted by affine warp).  Occluder pixels are subtracted from the
  swap mask — objects sit naturally ON TOP of the transformed face.

Failsafe:
  30-frame circular buffer → freeze → 10-frame fade-to-black → 5-frame fade-in.
  All triggers logged to failsafe.log with timestamps.
"""

